Drop-in versionlock fragments for packages rebuilt by the GTS9 port.

A fragment is a plain text list of rpm/dnf package specs, one per line;
lines starting with # are ignored. gts9wifi-update applies every *.list
file here after installing userspace packages. Use this for packages that
replace Fedora's versions (libfprint, fprintd, ffmpeg, ...), never for the
whole system.
